  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.RezObjectWithParams(InventoryItem: string, Params: {any}): uuid`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`key llRezObjectWithParams(string InventoryItem, list Params);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Instantiate <b>inventory</b> object at <b>pos</b> with an initial set of parameters specified in <b>params</b>.</p>
  <p><b>pos</b> will default to the position of the object containing the script, unless REZ_POS is specified. (see below)</p>
  <p>Returns a key which will be the key of the object when it is successfully rezzed in the world. On failure, returns `(key)""` (in LSL), or `NULL_KEY` (in Lua).</p>
</p>
